  "result": "The bulk import is implemented; typecheck, lint and the full suite pass (635 tests, including a new `tests/server/issue-import.test.ts`). No existing visible test needed changing.\n\nOne thing you should know: the rate allowance currently caps a single import at 60 rows for every workspace. The `issue:create` bucket holds 60 tokens at the free-plan size, and nothing in the app registers a workspace's plan with the limiter (`setOrgPlan` is never called). So a batch of 61–500 rows is always refused, even though the schema allows 500. I left that alone to match how the other services use the limiter; say if you want `importIssues` to register the plan before spending.",
